{"seq":50,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r3-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-er-l3-mu-v04-dev/er-12-l3-marrow-agrisupply-contact/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T23:27:21.642Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f3521ffdd3e8bca156aa9e25075c46d32e500254c15d78cde5428a25fa9251a7","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"Hi Hollis, call Caspian Halvorsen. On Oct 14 you told me here that he's your go-to escalation contact at Marrow Agrisupply for the Nettle rollout, and nothing newer has replaced him. I don't have a phone number or email for him anywhere I can see, so you'll need his details from your own contacts. If it's a store rollout issue, Pree has been the one talking to Marrow's store ops (#central-team, Jun 9), so it may help to loop her in.","thread_ts":"1792591200.000132"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792591200.000133","thread_ts":"1792591200.000132"}}
